strengths_contributions.value:
- This paper constructs a comprehensive dataset and benchmark, providing a large-scale, unified dataset for multi-modal image generation, combining both text-only and text-image conditioning. The concept of evaluating all aspects of generative models are necessary and important;
- the data curation pipeline is helpful;
- The proposed dataset' multi-view, multi-modal nature, and comprehensive tagging, promote a broad range of generation research beyond existing benchmarks.

